{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "账户层权限",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 105.52,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "前面讲的，都是合约层的权限。账户本身，也有权限。",
   "spoken": "前面讲的，都是合约层的权限。账户本身，也有权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.784,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 6.54
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "以太坊的外部账户，只有一把私钥。",
   "spoken": "以太坊的外部账户，只有一把私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 7.604,
   "dur": 3.552,
   "speechStart": 7.702,
   "speechEnd": 10.321
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "TRON 不一样。按 TRON 官方文档和安全公司的公开资料，它的账户原生支持多重权限。",
   "spoken": "TRON 不一样。按 TRON 官方文档和安全公司的公开资料，它的账户原生支持多虫权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.376,
   "dur": 7.752,
   "speechStart": 11.474,
   "speechEnd": 18.293
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "Owner 权限最高，能修改其他权限，包括增删签名人。",
   "spoken": "Owner 权限最高，能修改其他权限，包括增删签名人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 19.348,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 19.446,
   "speechEnd": 23.648
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "Active 管日常操作，比如转账、质押、调用合约。它可以有多个，每个可以限定操作类型。",
   "spoken": "Active 管日常操作，比如转账、质押、掉用合约。它可以有多个，每个可以限定操作类型。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.704,
   "dur": 8.568,
   "speechStart": 24.802,
   "speechEnd": 32.43
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "Witness 只管超级代表，也就是出块节点的相关操作。",
   "spoken": "Witness 只管超级代表，也就是出块节点的相关操作。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 33.492,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 33.59,
   "speechEnd": 37.709
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "每个权限有一组地址，每个地址有权重。",
   "spoken": "每个权限有一组地址，每个地址有权重。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 38.776,
   "dur": 4.224,
   "speechStart": 38.874,
   "speechEnd": 42.171
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "权重加起来达到阈值，操作才执行。",
   "spoken": "权重加起来达到阈值，操作才执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 43.22,
   "dur": 3.792,
   "speechStart": 43.318,
   "speechEnd": 46.175
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "这套设计，被骗子用来做多签诈骗。",
   "spoken": "这套设计，被骗子用来做多签诈骗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 47.232,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 47.33,
   "speechEnd": 50.413
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "第一步，受害者在假钱包或钓鱼页上，泄露了私钥。",
   "spoken": "第一步，受害者在假钱包或钓鱼页上，泄漏了私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 51.46,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 51.558,
   "speechEnd": 55.689
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "第二步，攻击者修改账户权限，把 Owner 和 Active 都改成自己。",
   "spoken": "第二步，攻击者修改账户权限，把 Owner 和 Active 都改成自己。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 56.744,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 56.842,
   "speechEnd": 62.044
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "第三步，受害者还能看到余额，但已经转不出来。",
   "spoken": "第三步，受害者还能看到余额，但已经转不出来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 63.108,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 63.206,
   "speechEnd": 66.848
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "转入不需要签名。新的 USDT，还会继续转进来。",
   "spoken": "转入不需要签名。新的 USDT，还会继续转进来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 67.888,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 67.986,
   "speechEnd": 72.245
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "攻击者不急。账户看起来正常，他择机再全部转走。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不急。账户看起来正常，他择机再全部转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 73.292,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 73.39,
   "speechEnd": 78.078
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "这种骗局，也常见于场外交易。",
   "spoken": "这种骗局，也常见于场外交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 79.128,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 79.226,
   "speechEnd": 81.654
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "骗子给你一个有余额、却转不出来的账户私钥，诱导你付手续费。",
   "spoken": "骗子给你一个有余额、却转不出来的账户私钥，诱导你付手续费。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 82.708,
   "dur": 5.448,
   "speechStart": 82.806,
   "speechEnd": 87.306
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "对合约开发者，这里有一个含义。",
   "spoken": "对合约开发者，这里有一个含义。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 88.376,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 88.474,
   "speechEnd": 90.795
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "在 TRON 上，一个地址等于一把私钥，这个假设不成立。",
   "spoken": "在 TRON 上，一个地址等于一把私钥，这个假设不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 91.86,
   "dur": 4.728,
   "speechStart": 91.958,
   "speechEnd": 95.767
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "收到一个地址，不能假设它由单一私钥控制。设成 owner 之前，先查它的权限配置。",
   "spoken": "收到一个地址，不能假设它由单一私钥控制。设成 owner 之前，先查它的权限配置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 96.808,
   "dur": 7.512,
   "speechStart": 96.906,
   "speechEnd": 103.487
  }
